# Practice Portfolio — {{TITLE}}

The portfolio demonstrates selected capabilities; it is not a dump of every exercise.

## Selection criteria

- The piece answers a clear brief or intent.
- The learner's contribution and any collaboration are explicit.
- References, licenses, and permissions are recorded.
- Process evidence shows meaningful decisions and revision.
- The final artifact meets a written rubric or audience need.
- Sensitive, confidential, or unauthorized material is excluded.

## Portfolio gate

- [ ] Each selected piece maps to one or more skill IDs.
- [ ] Each piece includes a concise context, role, process, and outcome statement.
- [ ] At least one piece demonstrates response to critique.
- [ ] At least one piece demonstrates independent direction.
- [ ] Claims about impact are supported by evidence.

Track candidates in [[tracking/portfolio-tracker.csv|the portfolio tracker]] and document each with [[practice/_portfolio-piece-template|the piece template]].
